title    Weserstraße
about    Motorik for a long drive down a short street. One chord, a steady beat, a guitar line that never quite resolves.
tempo    138
beats    4
steps    2
reverb   0.2

voice lead  square   vol=0.55 pan=0.3 bright=0.6
voice drone organ    vol=0.5  pan=-0.25
voice bass  synbass  vol=0.95
voice kick  kick     vol=0.85
voice snare snare    vol=0.5
voice hat   hat      vol=0.4  pan=0.2

pattern intro
kick | x...x.x. | % |
hat  | xxxxxxxx | % |

pattern A
bass  | E2 E2 E3 E2 E2 E2 E3 E2 | % | D2 D2 D3 D2 D2 D2 D3 D2 | E2 E2 E3 E2 E2 E2 E3 E2 |
drone | E4+B4------- | = | D4+A4------- | E4+B4------- |
kick  | x...x.x. | % | % | % |
snare | ..x...x. | % | % | ..x...xx |
hat   | xxxxxxxx | % | % | % |

pattern A2 from A
lead | B4- E5- F#5- G5- | A5--- G5- F#5- | E5------- | . . B4 D5 E5 F#5 G5 A5 |

play intro
loop A A2 A2 A
